{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08978","headline":"西郊燕集 · 韦应物","name":"西郊燕集","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"济济衆君子，高宴及时光。\n羣山霭遐瞩，绿野布熙阳。\n列坐遵曲岸，披襟袭兰芳。\n野庖荐嘉鱼，激涧泛羽觞。\n衆鸟鸣茂林，绿草延高冈。\n盛时易徂谢，浩思坐飘扬。\n眷言同心友，兹游安可忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08978.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08978","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}